ie we Francji. Tymczasem Ryszard, który dołączył do opozycji antykomunistycznej, coraz bardziej angażuje się w działania ruchu. Mężczyzna nawiązuje nawet współpracę z robotnikami z Ursusa, z którymi postanawia przygotować, a następnie rozdawać ulotki, zarówno w mieście, jak i w zakładzie. Adam Komornicki w dalszym ciągu osacza Kasię oraz Małgosię. Zdeterminowany mężczyzna domag"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795527900","title":"Atmosfera","released":"2026-11-24T13:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T13:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T14:05:00Z","runtime":"20 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795529100","title":"Tut i tam","released":"2026-11-24T14:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T14:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T14:30:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795530600","title":"Wąsy Sarmaty","released":"2026-11-24T14:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T14:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T15:00:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795532400","title":"Wot tak","released":"2026-11-24T15:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T15:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T15:40:00Z","runtime":"40 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795534800","title":"Główny temat","released":"2026-11-24T15:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T15:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T16:20:00Z","runtime":"40 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795537200","title":"Wot tak Mołdowa","released":"2026-11-24T16:20:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T16:20:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T16:40:00Z","runtime":"20 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795538400","title":"Wot tak Kazachstan","released":"2026-11-24T16:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T16:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T17:00:00Z","runtime":"20 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_02000c380589503569021504_epg_1795539600","title":"Belsat Online","released":"2026-11-24T17:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T17:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T17:15:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kep